Mobile renderer: specialized pipelines compiled ahead when ubershaders are off

rendering/shader_compiler/ubershaders/specialized_pipelines (default empty): twelve numbers per pipeline, as
printed by a run with rendering/shader_compiler/ubershaders/print_specialized_pipelines. With ubershaders off,
each one is compiled in the background, behind every other task, as soon as a surface it names is known; a frame
that needs one before its turn compiles it itself. Applies after 0002. Against godotengine/godot 4.7.2-stable
(ed1daf0).

